# CVE-2023-26114 — false positive
# Trivy matches this against the package.json inside the code-server bundle
# and reads the version field as "1.114.0", which is actually the bundled
# VS Code engine version, not the code-server application version.
# The actual code-server release (4.x) has been patched since 4.10.1.
CVE-2023-26114
